{"displayStem":"후두를 위에서 본 두 모식도는 같은 후두의 가·나 상태다. 피열연골의 성대돌기는 점으로 표시했다. 가→나에서 관찰되는 운동을 일으키는 주된 근육을 묻는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 모식도 · 크기 비례 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"구조 관계를 단순화한 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"470\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"150\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">가</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">나</text><path d=\"M160 90L105 300L215 300Z\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M560 90L440 300L680 300Z\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"300\" rx=\"90\" ry=\"25\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"560\" cy=\"300\" rx=\"150\" ry=\"25\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><path d=\"M160 100L155 270M160 100L165 270\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M560 100L475 270M560 100L645 270\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"></path><ellipse cx=\"155\" cy=\"270\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"165\" cy=\"270\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"475\" cy=\"270\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"645\" cy=\"270\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"50\" y=\"360\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">성문 폭이 좁음</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"360\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">성문 폭이 넓어짐</text></svg></div></div>"]}